The OpenArm v2 robot model -- its meshes, pedestal and joint limits -- is
Enactic's and is vendored unmodified as a git submodule under
third_party/openarm_mujoco. Nothing in that submodule has been changed.

scenes/tray_grasp_scene.xml is derived from that project's
v2/pedestal/balance_scene.xml: the tray, its handle posts and the ball were
added, and the asset paths were repointed at the submodule.

web/ik.js and web/model-vfs.js are copied unmodified from that project: the
browser demo drives the same left/right_ee_control_point sites through the same
damped-least-squares solve, and loads scenes into an MjVFS by the same rules.
web/tray.js is a port of this repository's own openarm_gym/control/bimanual_tray.py.
